sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant AgentService as Agent Service
    participant Repository
    participant FileSelector as File Selector Agent
    participant Agents as Security Agents
    participant Models as Chinou Models
    participant Store as A2A Task Store

    User->>Frontend: Submit repository name
    Frontend->>AgentService: Start security scan

    AgentService->>Repository: Temporarily clone repository
    Repository-->>AgentService: Repository files

    AgentService->>FileSelector: Select vulnerable files
    FileSelector-->>AgentService: Top 50 files

    AgentService->>Agents: Send selected files

    Note over Agents: Recon Agent<br/>Taint Agent<br/>Patterns Agent<br/>Logic Agent<br/>Dependency Scan Agent

    Agents->>Models: Analyze files
    Models-->>Agents: Vulnerability findings

    Agents->>Store: Store phase artifacts
    AgentService-->>Frontend: Return scan results
    Frontend-->>User: Display vulnerabilities